<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 5.084 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 5.084 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 5.084 billion pesos from the secondary market on Tuesday through six auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered or assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>	900 million  17 days   25.53 pct</p>
<p>	900 million  16 days</p>
<p>	1.700 bln  14 days</p>
<p>	600 million   9 days</p>
<p>	600 million   8 days</p>
<p>	384 million   1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
